CHISTO VOSTOCHNOY NATSIONAL'NOSTI."

00:26:20.541 --> 00:26:22.678
CHISTO VOSTOCHNOY NATSIONAL'NOSTI!

00:26:25.266 --> 00:26:28.095
farshteyst? ikh hob glaykh farshtanen.

