00:26:42.293 --> 00:26:47.260
ARMYANIN," zog ikh, "GAROYAN MIKHAIL GURGENOVICH.

00:26:48.452 --> 00:26:52.070
VOT MOY NOMER: CHETYRNADTSAT' SEMNADSAT'... CHETYRNADTSAT',

