00:27:05.445 --> 00:27:06.586
YA POSHЁL.

00:27:08.179 --> 00:27:09.405
bay mir iz shveys,

00:27:09.934 --> 00:27:13.471
shveys avekgegangen do nit keyn kalte, shoyn heyse.

00:27:14.710 --> 00:27:16.374
MELKONYAN MENYA ZHDAL,

00:27:17.342 --> 00:27:22.060
SMOTREL VOT ETU SAMUYU K- TRAGIKOMEDIYU.

