ONI PRIKAZALI VSEKH MEZHDU SOBOY RAZGOVARIVAT',

00:27:34.555 --> 00:27:39.920
 SKAZAT' KAKIE R- RODSTVENNIKI, BYSTRO GOVORIT', I GDE KTO ZHIVЁT, I GDE, KTO KEM RABO-

00:27:39.920 --> 00:27:43.210
KEM KTO RABOTAET. VY PONIMAETE?

00:27:44.292 --> 00:27:47.880
VOT ONI PROSHLI VOT ETU PROVERKU VSYU ETU,

00:27:47.953 --> 00:27:49.550
TAK IKH VYPUSTILI.

00:27:50.029 --> 00:27:54.540
A YA MOG BY RAZGOVARIVAT' PO-IKHNEMU, PO-ARMYANSKI?

00:27:54.788 --> 00:27:56.199
