00:27:56.273 --> 00:27:59.770
MOIKH RODSTVENNIKOV NA ARMYANSKOM, PONIMAESH', YAZYKE,

00:27:59.770 --> 00:28:02.510
IM PEREVESTI, GDE NAKHODYATSYA, GDE CHTO?

00:28:04.137 --> 00:28:05.751
YA TUT PROSHЁL.

00:28:07.461 --> 00:28:08.670
YA TUT PROSHЁL.

00:28:10.870 --> 00:28:12.298
NO SERDTSE MOЁ,

00:28:13.671 --> 00:28:18.440
ONO POLUCHIL ESHCHЁ ODIN ⟨PAMFLET⟩ NAZAD.

00:28:19.560 --> 00:28:20.786
YA NE DAROM,

00:28:21.923 --> 00:28:24.111
